  "Emperor penguins are surprisingly flexible survivors.",
  "Scientists track these birds from space by spotting their guano stains on ice.",
  "Data reveals many colonies have existed for decades longer than we realized.",
  "The Smyley Island colony even survived a total breeding failure in 2022.",
  "These birds adapt by moving to icebergs when their usual habitat disappears.",
  "One bad year doesn't mean the end for these resilient colonies."
